3. African Union Continental AI Strategy
August 2024

The African Union endorsed a continental AI strategy focused on development, responsible AI, regional cooperation, and strengthening Africa's capacity to develop and use AI. Education and skills development form part of the wider effort to prepare African countries for AI-driven economic and social change. 

African Union




The strategy provides a regional policy direction. Its publication does not mean every member state has implemented the recommendations.

