4. African Union Digital Education Strategy
2023–2028

The AU's Digital Education Strategy and Implementation Plan promotes digital technology in teaching, learning, research, assessment, and administration. It also emphasises digital skills and stronger infrastructure for education systems. 

African Union




These priorities create a policy foundation for AI-enabled learning, although countries still need suitable budgets, implementation plans, and outcome measurements.

